{"metadata": {"team_id": "Organizers", "run_id": "orga-splade-llama70b", "run_type": "automatic"}, "turn_id": "6-2_3", "responses": [{"rank": 1, "text": "Yes, shampoos with niacinamide and Lactic Acid or LHA can be beneficial for treating oily hair. Niacinamide is known to help regulate sebum production, while Lactic Acid and LHA can help break down excess oil and purify the scalp. To further manage oily hair, consider using a scalp scrub or exfoliating treatment once or twice a week to remove dead skin cells and other debris that can clog pores and contribute to oil buildup. Also, try to limit your use of heavy styling products and avoid touching your hair excessively, as this can transfer oils from your hands to your hair. Finally, consider using a dry shampoo or a powder to absorb excess oil between washes. These can be especially helpful on days when you don't have time to wash your hair. By incorporating these tips into your routine, you can help keep your oily hair under control and maintain a healthy, balanced scalp.", "citations": {"clueweb22-en0009-83-04895:6": 5.841487884521484, "clueweb22-en0034-84-18730:2": 5.687180042266846, "clueweb22-en0006-71-15684:13": 5.3212127685546875, "clueweb22-en0009-83-04895:9": 5.280932426452637, "clueweb22-en0037-88-13863:19": 5.167840957641602}, "ptkb_provenance": ["I frequently use heat styling tools to keep my hair looking good."]}], "references": {"clueweb22-en0009-83-04895:6": 5.841487884521484, "clueweb22-en0034-84-18730:2": 5.687180042266846, "clueweb22-en0006-71-15684:13": 5.3212127685546875, "clueweb22-en0009-83-04895:9": 5.280932426452637, "clueweb22-en0037-88-13863:19": 5.167840957641602, "clueweb22-en0043-96-12746:6": 5.147582530975342, "clueweb22-en0035-76-19435:4": 5.129895210266113, "clueweb22-en0027-31-18415:14": 4.907382488250732, "clueweb22-en0009-83-04895:8": 4.888643264770508, "clueweb22-en0009-83-04895:7": 4.839855194091797, "clueweb22-en0040-52-09315:12": 4.839529991149902, "clueweb22-en0004-09-06013:1